<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Sign in - QistManager</title>
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#6366f1">
    <link rel="manifest" href="<%= pwa_manifest_path %>">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icon.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "site", "auth", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
  </head>
  <body class="qm-auth-body">
    <main class="qm-auth-shell">
      <section class="qm-auth-story" aria-label="About QistManager">
        <div class="qm-auth-brand">
          <div class="qm-auth-logo"><i class="bi bi-cash-coin" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
          <div>
            <span class="qm-auth-brand-name"><%= platform_brand_name %></span>
            <span class="qm-auth-brand-tagline">Business management, simplified</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="qm-auth-story-content">
          <span class="qm-auth-eyebrow">YOUR BUSINESS. ONE PLACE.</span>
          <h2>Less paperwork.<br>More progress.</h2>
          <p>Keep your sales, installments, and accounts connected. Stay focused on moving your business forward.</p>
          <ul class="qm-auth-features">
            <li><span><i class="bi bi-wallet2" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><strong>Stay on top of collections</strong><small>Track installments and customer balances.</small></div></li>
            <li><span><i class="bi bi-box-seam" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><strong>Keep your business organized</strong><small>Manage inventory, sales, and purchases.</small></div></li>
            <li><span><i class="bi bi-bar-chart" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><strong>See the bigger picture</strong><small>Follow your accounts and business reports.</small></div></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="qm-auth-story-footer">Built for your everyday business.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="qm-auth-panel" aria-labelledby="sign-in-title">
        <%= yield %>
        <p class="qm-auth-footer"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i> Your workspace, securely connected.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
